Description: office internet gateway control panel (Ubuntu 26.04)
 Web control panel for a local office internet gateway: network, DHCP,
 DNS and VPN connections are managed in the browser, without the
 command line.
 .
 Early test build: not intended for production offices. Installing this
 package changes no network configuration on the host.
 .
